          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko jyewe Daniyeli mperako ndaraba, mara iminsi ndwaye. Bukeye ndahaguruka nkora imirimo y'umwami ariko ntangazwa n'ibyo neretswe ibyo, nyamara nta muntu wabimenye.",
          "type": "text",
